sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant P as index.html / UI
  participant A as app.js
  participant D as settlement domain
  participant S as localStorage
  U->>P: Submit expense form
  P->>A: DOM submit event
  A->>A: Normalize and validate payer, date, amount, participants
  A->>S: Save workspace with new expense
  A->>A: Apply search / month / category filters
  A->>D: computeSettlement(filteredExpenses, members)
  D-->>A: totals, balances, net positions, transfers
  A->>P: Render ledger, charts and settlement
  U->>P: Change a filter
  P->>A: Input / change event
  A->>D: Recompute filtered expense set
  D-->>A: Updated settlement
  A->>P: Refresh dashboard